'''Amerilaser''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[American Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.

==Appearance ==
Amerilaser has a laser type of mesh as the base, with an American flag texture surrounding the whole thing. It has the blue part with the stars at the tip, the stripes at the middle, and the handle being solid blue.

==Trivia ==
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/116693694/Amerilaser-Blaster Amerilaser Blaster].
*Upon purchasing the [[American Item Pack]], players would receive this gun, the godly knife [[Old Glory]], and the godly pet [[Sammy]].
*It is part of a set with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Old Glory]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Old Glory Set|Old Glory Set]], and with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet [[Sammy]], making the Full Old Glory Set.
*When salvaged, it provides 72 godly [[Shards|shards]].

